        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for helm fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-63209: github.com/klauspost/compress: signed integer overflow in s2.NewDict() allows an attacker to bypass\n  repeat index validation and cause a process crash (bsc#1283642).\n- CVE-2026-81870: OpenTelemetry-Go: Information disclosure via exporter (bsc#1284104).\n- CVE-2026-85732: oras.land/oras-go/v2: blind SSRF via unvalidated Link header URL in pagination allows internal network\n  probing (bsc#1281112).\n",
